    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(201,219,226,.85), rgba(201,219,226,.85)), url('https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_HeroBackground_2.jpg') center/cover; padding: 90px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">THANK YOU</p>\n<h1 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 48px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 22px;\">Your onboarding guide is on the way.</h1>\n<p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 34px;\">Schedule a consultation with a private label specialist to walk through your guide, clarify next steps, and map out your product launch.</p>\n<a href=\"/pl-demo-book-consultation\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 38px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule a Consultation</a></div>\n</div>"
     },
     "child_css": {},
     "css": {},
     "id": 216207762346,
     "order": 0,
     "styles": {},
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 50px;\">\n<h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0px 0px 26px; text-align: center;\">How a typical onboarding goes.</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #333333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0px 0px 18px; text-align: center;\">Every client engagement follows the same five-phase process \u2014 from your first conversation to your first shipment. Here is a high-level view of what to expect over your first 90 days.</p>\n</div>"
     },
     "child_css": {},
     "css": {},
     "id": 216207762347,
     "order": 1,
     "styles": {},
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Your first 90 days with us.</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 18px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 60px;\">A high-level view of the milestones ahead. Your specialist will walk through each phase in detail.</p>\n<div style=\"position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 36px; left: 8%; right: 8%; height: 2px; background: #c9dbe2; z-index: 1;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(170px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; position: relative; z-index: 2;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 72px; height: 72px; background: white; border: 3px solid #6BA644; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 0 18px; position: relative; z-index: 2;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\">&nbsp;</circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"></circle><path d=\"M12 3v2M12 19v2M3 12h2M19 12h2\"></path><path d=\"m15.536 8.464-4.95 2.122-2.122 4.95 4.95-2.122z\"></path></svg></div>\n<div style=\"background: #6BA644; color: white; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">STEP 01</div>\n<p style=\"color: #6ba644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">WEEK 1</p>\n<h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.3;\">Kickoff Call</h3>\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Initial deep-dive on your audience, goals, and product vision.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 72px; height: 72px; background: white; border: 3px solid #6BA644; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 0 18px; position: relative; z-index: 2;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\"><path d=\"M12 21a9 9 0 0 1 0-18c4.97 0 9 3.582 9 8 0 1.333-.333 2-1 2h-1a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v1c0 1-.667 1.5-2 1.5\">&nbsp;</path><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"13.5\" r=\"1.5\"></circle><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"8.5\" r=\"1.5\"></circle><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"8.5\" r=\"1.5\"></circle></svg></div>\n<div style=\"background: #6BA644; color: white; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">STEP 02</div>\n<p style=\"color: #6ba644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">WEEK 2-3</p>\n<h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.3;\">Product Selection</h3>\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Finalize your SKU list and share brand assets with design.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 72px; height: 72px; background: white; border: 3px solid #6BA644; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 0 18px; position: relative; z-index: 2;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\"><path d=\"M15 15H9M15 12H9m6-3H9m12 1.5V18a3 3 0 0 1-3 3H6a3 3 0 0 1-3-3V6a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7.5L21 8.5Z\">&nbsp;</path></svg></div>\n<div style=\"background: #6BA644; color: white; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">STEP 03</div>\n<p style=\"color: #6ba644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">WEEK 4-5</p>\n<h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.3;\">Label Approval</h3>\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Design iteration until you approve. Approval starts production.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 72px; height: 72px; background: white; border: 3px solid #6BA644; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 0 18px; position: relative; z-index: 2;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\"><path d=\"M3 21h18M3 7v14M9 7v14M15 7v14M21 7v14M3 7l6-4 6 4 6-4\">&nbsp;</path><path d=\"M9 12h6M9 16h6\"></path></svg></div>\n<div style=\"background: #6BA644; color: white; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">STEP 04</div>\n<p style=\"color: #6ba644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">WEEK 6-9</p>\n<h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.3;\">Production</h3>\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\"><span>Completion of your brand products in our FDA-registered, cGMP certified facility.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 72px; height: 72px; background: white; border: 3px solid #6BA644; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 0 18px; position: relative; z-index: 2;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\"><path d=\"M5 17H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\">&nbsp;</path><rect x=\"9\" y=\"11\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\"></rect><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"></circle><path d=\"M9 15h3M14 11h3l2 4\"></path></svg></div>\n<div style=\"background: #6BA644; color: white; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">STEP 05</div>\n<p style=\"color: #6ba644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 6px;\">WEEK 10-12</p>\n<h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.3;\">Launch</h3>\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;\">Product ships to your warehouse. Time to start selling.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
     },
