    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<p style=\"color: #6ba644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">50+ YEARS OF PROVIDING TOP-QUALITY SUPPLEMENTS</p>\n<h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 20px;\">Developed by us. Made for you.</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement providers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Prexera is a division of FoodScience Corp, an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>\n</div>\n</div>"
     },
